<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "in_dream.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夢.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>How long had I slept?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The room was already pitch dark.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had I been asleep that long?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I looked around me, and could see nothing at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The faint lamps on the computer and the TV, at least, ought to have been visible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>, where is she? What time is it now? Huh?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夢桜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And then, before my eyes, floating in pitch darkness, a cherry tree in full bloom.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no wind, and the petals were falling fluttering straight down.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\うめき声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Nn... nngh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A moan coming from somewhere, impossible to tell as a man's or a woman's.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Where on earth was this place?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was familiar.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This place is Chuo Park, in Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The scene where that incident earlier is said to have happened...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When spring comes, a great many cherries burst into bloom and the place <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="にぎ">bustles</STYLE> with crowds of people.
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\中央公園素材\御神木.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The great cherry tree towering there is what is called the goshinboku of Chuo Park. [TN: the sacred tree of a shrine, held to house a god]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even in Motoki-cho, with all its cherries, it is a particularly big tree, and the blossom it puts out is deeply <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="こうごう">divine</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="まがまが">baleful</STYLE>.<PG>
Despite its being this season, there was next to no sign of anyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\うめき声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Except, that is, for the moan coming from somewhere―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Where was this voice coming from?
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
<PG>
When I looked at the foot of the goshinboku, something in the shape of a person was lying there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Looking closely, it was faintly writhing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No mistake about it, the moan is that person's.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The voice sounded in great pain, but there was nobody around to call on for help.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hurried, running up close.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\走る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "2000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夢桜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\赤人.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
―!!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I lost my words for a moment at the strange state of that person.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That person's form is bright red.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A bright red human being is lying there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Neither the features nor the age, not even the sex, can be told.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But alive! Still alive!<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Are you all right!? I'll call an ambulance right away!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\うめき声2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Nnngh... aahh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The red person, moving their body in response to my voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is a state where every moment counts.
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
<PG>
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "2000" "PASS"}
Just then, a strong wind blew through between us and the goshinboku.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Bright red cherry blossoms poured down from the goshinboku and flew about me.
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
<PG>
But what touched my skin was not the feel of petals, which should have been a light brush.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sticky, faintly cold, an unpleasant <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="ひまつ">spatter</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPS>No... this is not blossom!<PG>
{PLAYSND "残滓念.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYMOVIE "赤い雨.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "200" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<TXSPN>It is blood.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Blood is pouring down like rain.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What? This..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My whole body was being painted over, before my eyes, in a dark, murky red.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\夢の目.lcm" "REPEAT" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\夢の目1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "669" "262" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{QUAKE "人物2" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "5" "0" "1"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Keeping my face turned up, I slowly turned only my eyes downward.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For the first time I saw the red person's face clearly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The bright red human being was looking back at me too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Bloodshot eyes wide open, as though, unable to speak, they were trying to plead something by the sheer force of that stare―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As though I had been bound in iron, I could not move.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Right away... I'll call for help."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
{MESON "500"}
My legs finally moved, and I drew one step back.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\つかもう.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "-900" "C" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\nつかむ手\r\n000\r\n3\r\n0\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\nつかむ手\r\n000\r\n3\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\つかむ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\ドーン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Suddenly, the bright red human being seized my ankle.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The grip is terribly strong...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{QUAKE "000" "QUAKE" "1" "0" "15" "0" "30"}
{PLAYSND "SE\bakibaki.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I wanted to shake it off, but my strength was not enough.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I felt a cold sweat running down my back.<PG>
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Stop...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I said that―<PG>
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{MESOFF "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\雑魚.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "300"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\赤顔.lmt" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "000" "CLICK"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家時計0時0000.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\時計の時報.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\シナリオ\000過去へ馳せる夢\時計11回.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Huh...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
When I opened my eyes, I was on the sofa at <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>'s house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
A dream...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> seemed to be on the internet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> showed no particular sign of minding me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So even after a dream like that, I had been sleeping soundly.<PG>
There was no feel of the cold sweat I thought had run down my back, either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The sensation of my ankle being seized remained.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, that must be because I had my ankles crossed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I recrossed them the gripped feeling went away at once.<PG>
It seemed to have been entirely a dream.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I looked at the TV.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed to be that high-school board I had objected to.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> had not noticed that I had woken.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The board was, as expected, buried in talk of this morning's incident.<PG>
{PLAYSND "Take_It.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\掲示板.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\pc_keyboard.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
